questions.question:
Perhatikan potongan kode ISR berikut:
void buttonISR() { digitalWrite(LED_PIN, HIGH); delay(100); digitalWrite(LED_PIN, LOW); }
Saat interrupt dipicu, sistem mikrokontroler mendadak hang/freeze. Mengapa kode ini bermasalah?

questions.question_en:
Consider the following ISR code snippet:
void buttonISR() { digitalWrite(LED_PIN, HIGH); delay(100); digitalWrite(LED_PIN, LOW); }
When the interrupt is triggered, the microcontroller system freezes. Why is this code problematic?

